# ===== 文本规范化（Unity 推荐） =====
* text=auto
*.cs text
*.shader text
*.json text
*.meta text
*.txt text
*.md text
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tga binary
*.psd binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.fbx binary
